---
import site from '../data/site';
---

<section class="faq-section section-paper" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="container faq-layout">
    <div class="faq-intro"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Questions fréquentes</p><h2 id="faq-title">Avant de<br /><em>prendre la route.</em></h2><p>Une question qui n’est pas ici ? L’adresse et les coordonnées d’AutoBac66 sont au bout du fil.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Voir les coordonnées <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      {site.faq.map((item, index) => (
        <details class="faq-item" open={index === 0}>
          <summary><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><strong>{item.question}</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>{item.answer}</p></div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
